      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Код решения"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "text": "def F(x, a1, a2):\n    P = 15 <= x <= 40\n    Q = 21 <= x <= 63\n    A = a1 <= x <= a2\n    return P <= ((Q and (not A)) <= (not P))\n\nR = []\nM = [x / 4 for x in range(5 * 4, 80 * 4)]\nfor a1 in M:\n    for a2 in M:\n        if all(F(x, a1, a2) for x in M):\n            R.append(a2 - a1)\nprint(round(min(R)))\n\n# Ответ: 19"
